(3, NULL, 'ITA สสอ.ปง 2568', NULL, '<p><strong>MOIT1 </strong></p><p><strong>1. คำสั่ง / ประกาศ ที่ระบุกรอบแนวทาง</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.1-%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.1 มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารลงนามในคำสั่ง / ประกาศ</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.2%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.2 มีคำสั่ง / ประกาศ โดยผู้บริหารสูงสุดของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.3 มีกรอบแนวทางการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.4-%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.4 มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>2. รายงานผลการกำกับติดตามการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงานในปีที่ผ่านมา (ของปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ. 2567)</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2.1%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1-%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%AF.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2.1 มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารลงนามรับทราบรายงานฯ</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2.2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2.2 มีรายงานผลการกำกับติดตามการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงานในปีที่ผ่านมา (ของปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ. 2567)</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT1%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2.3-%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2.3 มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>MOIT2 </strong></p><p><strong>1. ข้อมูลพื้นฐานที่เป็นปัจจุบัน ประกอบด้วย</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MOIT2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.1%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-1.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.1 ข้อมูลผู้บริหาร</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.2 นโยบายของผู้บริหาร</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.3 โครงสร้างหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%8E%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87-%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%8E%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.4 หน้าที่และอำนาจของหน่วยงานตามกฎหมายจัดตั้ง หรือกฎหมายอื่นที่เกี่ยวข้อง</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.5%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%8E%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%8F%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.5 กฎหมายที่เกี่ยวข้องกับการดำเนินงาน หรือการปฏิบัติงานของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><u>