%93%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%93-%E0%B8%9E.%E0%B8%A8.-2568.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีหนังสือจัดสรรงบประมาณของหน่วยงาน ประจำปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ. 2568</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.3-%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%9E.%E0%B8%A8.-2568.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีแผนการจัดซื้อจัดจ้างและการจัดหาพัสดุของหน่วยงาน ประจำปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ. 2568</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.4-%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%94-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">4. มีคำสั่งมอบหมายการปิดประกาศ หรือปลดประกาศ</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.5-%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0