trong>ไตรมาสที่ 2</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT18%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%AD_%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารลงนามในคำสั่ง / ข้อสั่งการ / ประกาศ </a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT18%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีมาตรการป้องกันการทุจริต (การควบคุมความเสี่ยงการทุจริต) อย่างเป็นรูปธรรมที่ชัดเจน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/MOIT18%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD3%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีหลักฐานหนังสือแจ้งเวียน ตามข้อ 1. ถึงข้อ 2.</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT18%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD4%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">4. มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>MOIT19</strong></p><p><strong>ไตรมาสที่ 2</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT19%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A3.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารรับทราบการรายงานการเรี่ยไรและการให้หรือรับของขวัญ หรือประโยชน์อื่นใด</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT19%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%AB%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%8D%E0%B8%AB-Print-%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A-MSRS.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีรายงานการเรี่ยไรและการให้หรือรับของขวัญหรือประโยชน์อื่นใดที่พิมพ์ (Print) จากระบบ MSRS</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT19%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD3%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>ไตรมาสที่ 4</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MOIT19%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A3.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารรับทราบการรายงานการเรี่ยไร</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MOIT19%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีรายงานการเรี่ยไรและการให้หรือรับของขวัญหรือประโยชน์</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MOIT19%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD3%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>MOIT20</strong></p><p><strong>1. มีหลักฐานโครงการอบรมเรื่องผลประโยชน์ทับซ้อนโดยใช้หลักสูตรต้านทุจริตศึกษา</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT20%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.1%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.1 บันทึกข้อความขออนุมัติดำเนินโครงการ</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT20%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1.2%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%92%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%AA%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A0%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%90.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.2 โครงการและมีการขออนุญาตนำไปเผยแพร่บนเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT20%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารรับทราบรายงานผลโครงการอบรมเรื่องผลประโยชน์ ทับซ้อนโดยใช้หลักสูตรต้านทุจริตศึกษา</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT20%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีรายงานผลการอบรมเรื่องผลประโยชน์ทับซ้อนโดยใช้หลักสูตรต้านทุจริตศึกษา</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT20%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD5%E0%B8%A0%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%AF.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">4. มีภาพกิจกรรมที่ระบุวัน เวลา สถานที่จัดกิจกรรม</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT20%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD6%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">5. มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>MOIT21</strong></p><p><strong>ไตรมาส 2</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT21%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารลงนามในประกาศเจตนารมณ์ตามข้อ 1.1 ถึงข้อ 1.3 </a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT21%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-2.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีประกาศเจตนารมณ์ตามข้อ 1.1 ถึงข้อ 1.3 ของผู้บริหารสูงสุด (จำนวน 3 ฉบับ)</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT21%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD3-%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีกิจกรรมประกาศเจตนารมณ์ตามข้อ 1.1 ถึงข้อ 1.3 ของหน่วยงาน </a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT21%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD4%E0%B8%A0%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%93%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">4. มีภาพถ่ายกิจกรรม ที่ระบุวัน เวลา สถานที่จัดกิจกรรมที่ชัดเจน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT21%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD5%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">5. มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>MOIT22</strong></p><p><strong>ไตรมาส 2</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT22-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. มีบันทึกข้อความ ที่ผู้บริหารรับทราบคู่มือแนวปฏิบัติการป้องกันและแก้ไขปัญหา การล่วงละเมิดหรือคุกคามทางเพศในการทำงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT22-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD2%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%8F%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%89%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%8D.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. คู่มือแนวปฏิบัติการป้องกันและแก้ไขปัญหาการล่วงละเมิดหรือคุกคามทางเพศ ในการทำงานของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MOIT22-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD3%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. บันทึกข้อความแจ้งเวียนคู่มือแนวปฏิบัติการป้องกันและแก้ไขปัญหาการล่วงละเมิดหรือคุกคามทางเพศในการทำงาน</a></u></p><p><strong>ไตรมาสที่ 4</strong></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MOIT22-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD-1-%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1-1.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. มีบันทึกข้อความ</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MOIT22-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD-2-%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A8.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. มีรายงานผลการดำเนินงาน</a></u></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MOIT22-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD-3-%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3. มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณะผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></p>', 0, 1, '2025-10-06 13:20:39', '2025-10-06 13:49:02', NULL);
