8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B4%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%AB%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5-2567.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">มีบันทึกข้อความที่ผู้บริการลงนามรับทราบรายงานการวิเคราะห์ผลการจัดซื้อจัดจ้างและการจัดหาพัสดุ ประจำปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ.2567และมีการขออนุญาตนำไปเผยแพร่บนเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT3-2-%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B4%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%AB%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5-2567.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">มีรายงานการวิเคราะห์ผลการจัดซื้อจัดจ้างและการจัดหาพัสดุประจำปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ. 2567 </a></u></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT3-3-%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9C%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">มีแบบฟอร์มการเผยแพร่ข้อมูลต่อสาธารณสุขผ่านเว็บไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></li></ol><p>MOIT4</p><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>ประกาศเผยแพร่แผนการจัดซื้อจัดจ้างและการจัดหาพัสดุ ประจำปีของหน่วยงาน ภายใน 30 วันทำการ ระบุวันที่ที่ได้รับการจัดสรรงบประมาณในช่องคำอธิบายชี้แจงประกอบหลักฐาน วันที่ได้ทำการประกาศเผยแพร่ให้ชัดเจน</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1-1-%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5-%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9A-2568.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1. 1บันทึกข้อความที่ผู้บริหารลงนามรับทราบแผนการจัดซื้อจัดจ้างประจำปีงบประมาณของหน่วยงานและมีการขออนุญาตนำไปเผยแพร่บนเว็ปไซต์ของหน่วยงาน</a></u></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD12-%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%93-%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5-2568.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1.2.มีหนังสือจัดสรรงบประมาณของหน่วยงาน ประจำปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ.2568</a></u></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>1.3.มีแผนการจัดซื้อจัดจ้างและการจัดหาพัสดุของหน่วยงาน ประจำปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ.2568</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD12-%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B7%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%93-%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5-2568.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">– งบลงทุน</a></u></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B5-68-%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%89%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%99.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">– งบเงินบำรุง</a></u></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><u><a href=\"https://www.ponghospital.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MOIT4-%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD1-4-%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87-%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8